# claude: this fork never had a .gitignore at all - build outputs (kernel
# ELF/asm listing, mkfs, initcode, per-program *.asm disassembly listings,
# the linked user _binaries, fs.img) were untracked but cluttering `git
# status` after every build. None of these are checked-in source; unlike
# forks/rpi1's source/fs.img or forks/loongarch's ramdisk.h, this port's
# Makefile builds fs.img fresh from mkfs + UPROGS every time, so nothing
# here needs to be tracked.
kernel/kernel
kernel/kernel.asm
kernel/*.sym
mkfs/mkfs
fs.img
user/*.asm
user/*.sym
user/initcode
user/initcode.out
user/usys.S
user/_*
